{"notes":["VERDICT: APPROVE — product-review (absorbs UX-review + holistic). Spike 4 harness di branch feat/spk-local-deploy-ux memenuhi semua AC FND local-direct-deploy + plan immutable. Premature DONE adalah sah (isolated proof harness, bukan prod anvil deploy) dan not-merged ke develop 765f42d adalah CORRECT per plan out-of-scope prod impl sebelum evidence.","SCOPE \u0026 STRATEGIC ALIGNMENT: Validasi ergonomics CLI CI-agnostic untuk solo dev/small team deploy dari local via SSH tanpa tunggu CI, sambil preserve Anvil ownership (lifecycle deterministic ADR-003 + verification-before-trust + identity-from-content). Harness reuse internal/output (envelope v1, AppError 3-part, PlainStepReporter) + internal/artifact (Package, VerifyArtifact) — zero prod surface, low maintenance, high user value vs feature cost. Timebox 2d parallel terpenuhi.","AC1 — dry-run human+JSON konsisten PASS: RunDryRun build via artifact.Package + VerifyArtifact (6 checks), human dryrun_human.txt (artifact_id/version/checksum + [PASS] per-check) dan JSON dryrun_json.json envelope {version:1,status:success,data:{artifact_id,version,checksum,verify}} share identity identik — ValidateHumanJSONConsistency PASS, dryrun_recording.txt manifest snippet + consistency PASS, no remote install (temp dir isolated). Ergonomi: anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e --dry-run [--json] orthogonal, tip 'remove --dry-run to push' discoverable.","AC2 — Network failure actionable PASS: ClassifiedError KindTimeout/KindUnreachable exit 1 (ExitCodeGeneral per exitcode.go carve-out), human error_human_timeout/unreachable.txt tunjuk user@host deploy@staging.example.com + Reason dial error + Resolution suggest retry 'anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e' + 'ssh -v user@host echo ok' + firewall hint. Matrix 6 kinds (error_matrix.md/csv) document show_ssh_target true + suggest_retry true. JSON error envelope machine-readable (error_json_timeout/unreachable.json) konsisten.","AC3 — Auth fail \u0026 redaction PASS: KindAuthFail/KindPermissionDenied exit 4 (ExitCodePrecondition), pesan jelas tanpa leak secret — RedactSecrets/SanitizeLogLine scrub DEPLOY_SSH_KEY, private header, id_rsa/id_ed25519/.pem paths ke [REDACTED]/[REDACTED_PATH], Resolution pakai placeholder \u003ckey\u003e/\u003cinstallDir\u003e + ssh-add 0600 hint. redaction_check.txt AssertNoSecretLeak nil, harness_test TestAC3_AuthFailRedactedNoLeak + RedactSecrets table PASS. Error_human_auth_fail/permission_denied.txt prove no raw path leak.","AC4 — Progress + Help PASS: DeployProgress wrap PlainStepReporter + PushTicks 0/25/50/75/100% per-chunk bytes (progress.log) + verification step per-check PASS/FAIL via output.StatusPass/Fail, varian verify FAIL di progress_verify_fail.log, Steps() recorded untuk test. Help snapshot help.txt lengkap: Usage --target/--dry-run/--json/--help, lifecycle build-\u003everify-\u003epush-\u003einstall-\u003eactivate, server.targets anvil.yaml snippet, Progress section, Exit codes 0/1/2/4 stable automation-safe (align ADR-010), On network/auth failure guidance, Secrets redaction note. ContainsDryRunInHelp true.","AC5 — UX review checklist PASS: ux_review_checklist.md 11 baris all PASS oleh 3 tester (A PM ergonomics/help actionability, B Dev output contracts/exit codes, C QA edge cases/no leak/progress visible). Recordings linked: dryrun_human/json/recording, progress.log, help.txt, error_matrix, 6x error samples, redaction_check.txt. Holistic UX: human vs machine konsisten (same artifact_id), help discoverable via --help, exit codes documented untuk CI, progress feedback visible tanpa spam.","HOLISTIC \u0026 CONSISTENCY: Human output pakai output.PrintStatus/FormatDuration konsisten dengan existing CLI conventions, JSON pakai output.WriteJSON/WriteJSONError envelope v1 — version/status/data/error shape stabil untuk automation. Verify-before-trust dan identity-from-content dihormati (manifest embedded). CI-agnostic trigger terdokumentasi di help (target declared di anvil.yaml, runtime tetap di server /.anvil state). Not-merged harness keep isolation — tidak menambah prod complexity.","TRADE-OFFS \u0026 RISKS: Isolasi mock vs real SSH streaming adalah trade-off sengaja timebox — risiko transport/race ditangani spike 1-3, produk minimise unnecessary complexity. Minor cosmetic 'Step: Build artifact...' duplicate line sebelum ✓ tidak blocking. JSON artifact_path full /tmp path untuk spike — prod pertimbangkan redact/persist path. Help duplikasi '-h, --help' bisa consolidate.","OPEN QUESTIONS \u0026 NEXT: Env promotion guard (prod confirm prompt + allowlist) belum di harness — rekomendasikan ADR saat promote. Registry vs direct stream (FND §6) tetap open. Recommendation APPROVE spike 4; tunggu convergence 4 spike parallel lalu promote FND ke req:local-deploy + adr:local-deploy-transport + scp:local-deploy-mvp. Jangan merge spikes/local-deploy-ux/ ke develop sebagai prod code sampai FND approved."],"role":"review","verdict":"approve"}